"},"script":{"count":16,"freeCount":15,"keyCount":3,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":95047916580305,"name":"[RIA26] The Block","desc":"Welcome to The Block from Roblox Innovation Studio; Roblox’s “Main Stage” where the future of entertainment is co-created with YOU!\n\n🔭 Discover What's Next: New artists and content creators that you’ll love.\n🎧 Live & Immersive: Join and influence events in real-time.\n⭐ Culture Unlocked: Connect directly with artists and celebrities.\n🎤 Own the Stage: Express your unique POV, perform live, and flex your style.\n👑 Exclusive Drop Zone: Score limited-edition UGC and real-world merch.\n🚀 Co-create the Future: Play with new tech and influence what we build next.\n\nRecently @ THE BLOCK: Aespa, Billie Eilish, BSlick, KATSEYE, Laufey, LE SSERAFIM, Miami XO, Netflix’s KPop Demon Hunters, Netflix’s Stranger Things: Tales from ‘85, overtonight, Parry Gripp, Roblox Creator Showdown, Sofi Tukker, Stray Kids, and The Knocks, The Rolling Stones, Tolou.\n\n💥 Photosensitivity: Flashing lights. 🛍️ Merch: Real-world items available.\n\n👍 & ⭐ favorite The Block for updates!","path":"/game/95047916580305-the-block","slug":"95047916580305-the-block","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ef202a5e02d9eca1ba02360eab52a1510303168a04111a9493b21d5f66f90dd7.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-879e292d30c63f2644d4322658ab972d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":21,"visitor":151003902,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-30T08:43:50.887Z","creator":{"name":"Live on Roblox","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14233281398,"name":"(PT3!!) Critical Revengeance","desc":"Welcome to Critical Revengeance! An open-world game that is a harder spin on the CA Genre (Although still heavily WIP.)\n\nPlease be aware that (MOST) of the songs in CR are from outside sources and are not original, and upon request will be removed if need be.\nWe DO have some official OSTs though.\nAZALI has granted us permission to use their songs, as long as it isn't a commissioned song.\n\nThis game is still in public testing phases, so expect MANY bugs, unfinished content, a lack of content, incorrect balancing, and anything to change. This game is mostly meant for PC, but it has some mobile and console support.\n\nThis game is developed by two people, one working on a backend recode. Game is still getting updated during recode period. Please know that updates will be way slower and inconsistent, and is a passion project.","path":"/game/14233281398-critical-revengeance","slug":"14233281398-critical-revengeance","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d79ea6a06ad714f0bef90ddc9deb579b85c5bc082f1c51af5bc77bb5445a8574.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0056d15b022d99c2eb4b74fe738c5542/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":21,"visitor":3964232,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-12T23:08:19.323Z","creator":{"name":"The Last Strike","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":136253801690395,"name":"[🎁] Clicky Keyboard Tower","desc":"Welcome to the original Clicky Keyboard Tower!🤤\n\nCan you climb a tower made of clicky keycaps with every step going clicky click?\nRelax and enjoy the various ASMR sounds of keyboard keys.\nBut be careful… one mistype and you’ll be back at the bottom, starting fresh.😵‍💫\n\n😴 Built for ASMR: soft sounds, smooth physics, satisfying clicks\n\n⭐Join CLICK CLACK STUDIO for FREE in-game items!⭐\n\nTags: Obby, Tower, ASMR, Clicky, Keyboard, Keycaps, Parkour, Multiplayer, Competitive, Ragdoll, Challenge, Speedrun, Trolling, Physics, Satisfying","path":"/game/136253801690395-clicky-keyboard-tower","slug":"136253801690395-clicky-keyboard-tower","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3e6687bd15cda78a67395b9070d4c93582d55ed80de68c9e820cd8ed02e3e9d7.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-025c23ab36f68b6f8e004a4ca743c6f6/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":21,"visitor":115178519,"verified":false,"u